@startuml
actor "用户" as User

boundary "PDF 面板界面" as PdfPaneUI
boundary "Markdown 编辑器界面" as MdEditorUI

control "锚点联 动控制器" as AnchorLinkController

entity "PDF 实体" as PdfEntity
entity "锚点实体" as AnchorEntity
entity "文档实体" as DocumentEntity

User -> PdfPaneUI : 点击 PDF 对象(obj)
PdfPaneUI -> AnchorLinkController : 创建锚点(pdfId, obj)

AnchorLinkController -> PdfEntity : 解析对象位置(obj)
PdfEntity --> AnchorLinkController : page,pos

AnchorLinkController -> AnchorEntity : 构建深链接(page,pos)
AnchorEntity --> AnchorLinkController : anchorLink

AnchorLinkController -> DocumentEntity : 在光标处插入(anchorLink)
AnchorLinkController -> MdEditorUI : 渲染插入的锚点(anchorLink)
@enduml